Z||000000||Pretender||09-21-2000||05:34 AM||||Thats right boys and girls. Hypnotise bought my 88gt and i went out and got myself a honda prelude. 1998 type SH. Blk/ blk inter. It's not to bad on the power or the handling. I always told myself that i would never own a front wheel drive car non the less a honda but this car has supprised me. it's got it all. I will still be in the fiero community and i am working on a few goodies i'm trying to pull together but my time is swamped. Well thats about enough of my blabbering. If you guys now hate me or wanna ask some question go ahead. thanks, shawn. ||||reg||6
Z||000001||contra||09-21-2000||08:20 AM||||there's nothing wrong with honda, just honda civics. Civics were never meant to go fast, nor were they ever considered race cars. The prelude does go fast (for example, the vtec one). If you decide to customize your new toy, just do it tastefull, and try to keep the mods functional. I have nothing wrong with people 'actually' improving their cars even if it is a honda, a neon, or ford, or whatever. just dont rice your car out  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>||||reg||1
